{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"F19B debugging phases one and two completed. The held-out suite reproduces CI with three failures. The read gate and its repository policy tests inspect only src/rebar/_config_schema.py, so changing the assertions to inspect the extracted module would omit VerifyConfig from gate coverage. The protected F19B worktree contains an in-progress correction that restores VerifyConfig to the canonical schema and moves validation helpers to the existing coercion seam. No edit was made in docs-f19b-ci-fix."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787484729999815001,"uuid":"f972f903-9236-468d-b5b0-14b808d1025a"}